<p>Throw your Dream Hammer at a distant location, inflicting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage on all targets between you and it.  After reaching its destination, the Dream Hammer will return, potentially hitting targets a second time.</p><p>Learning this talent increases the Accuracy of your Dream Hammer by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 20, 30, 40, 50.</acronym></p>